WEBVTT

00:07.599 --> 00:14.487
- Happy birthday to you, happy birthday to you
- Happy birthday to you, happy birthday to you

00:14.487 --> 00:19.372
- Happy birthday dear Tatiana
- Happy birthday dear Tatiana

00:19.706 --> 00:24.716
- Happy birthday to you
- Happy birthday to you

01:07.636 --> 01:09.388
Boom!

01:11.434 --> 01:14.941
<i>The Negator who Fuko and company
were trying to contact, Unrepair,</i>

01:14.941 --> 01:17.404
<i>was a member of those called the Negator Hunters.</i>

01:17.989 --> 01:22.081
<i>Their objective was the capture or murder of Chikara,</i>

01:22.331 --> 01:25.087
<i>the Negator captive on the ship as an auction item.</i>

01:25.212 --> 01:29.638
<i>Andy and Fuko stand before Unrepair,
who was about to fulfill that objective.</i>

01:30.180 --> 01:33.813
<i>Among the struggle with Unrepair
and his incompatible train of thought,</i>

01:33.813 --> 01:38.029
<i>Fuko suffers a wound from Unrepair's attack
that sees one brief window of opportunity.</i>

01:38.781 --> 01:42.079
<i>Wounds inflicted by Unrepair will never heal until he dies.</i>

01:42.329 --> 01:46.379
<i>Chikara, seeing that Fuko is facing death
because she shielded him,</i>

01:46.379 --> 01:48.968
<i>remembers his mother's words in her final moments,</i>

01:48.968 --> 01:51.222
<i>and bites down his fear to resolve himself.</i>

01:52.057 --> 01:54.813
<i>Unmove's Negator ability is to stop
the movement of anything he sees.</i>

01:55.188 --> 02:00.783
<i>Andy acknowledges and smiles at the bravery
of the boy who wanted to save Fuko with his ability.</i>

02:01.743 --> 02:07.087
<i>Meanwhile, the battle of another girl
who cares for Fuko is about to begin.</i>

02:09.467 --> 02:10.177
Boom!

02:11.262 --> 02:12.264
Creed! Feng!

02:12.515 --> 02:14.393
Not a problem!

02:15.312 --> 02:17.232
Gah! What now?

02:17.232 --> 02:18.109
Tatiana!

02:18.652 --> 02:24.079
Sorry I'm late, Fuko!
I'll deal with these two!

02:26.000 --> 02:28.547
You two handle the other two!

04:11.168 --> 04:13.924
20 mm rounds ain't makin' a dent, eh?

04:15.218 --> 04:17.347
That's one hell of a power suit y'got there.

04:19.059 --> 04:21.188
Boom!

04:31.125 --> 04:33.254
<i>That appeared out of thin air!</i>

04:33.254 --> 04:35.801
<i>Could it be his ability?
What is he negating?</i>

04:38.347 --> 04:39.349
Yī.

04:41.688 --> 04:45.696
<i>No way! They cracked the black metal armor
that Mr. Nico made?</i>

04:46.280 --> 04:49.369
<i>Is this their Negator ability?
How powerful.</i>

04:54.338 --> 04:55.925
<i>Tatiana! Can you hear me?</i>

04:56.258 --> 04:57.177
What do you want, Zombie?

04:57.845 --> 04:59.808
<i>All right. Listen calmly.</i>

04:59.808 --> 05:00.768
Wha?

05:02.479 --> 05:06.153
Fuko is injured!
Unrepair got her!

05:07.322 --> 05:08.659
That means...

05:09.076 --> 05:13.376
A wound inflicted by Unrepair
won't heal itself until he dies.

05:14.044 --> 05:16.508
<i>If what he said is true...</i>

05:16.675 --> 05:18.846
We only have one hour at most!

05:19.221 --> 05:21.810
We're gonna kill 'im before then!

05:24.022 --> 05:28.030
Oh? What's the matter?
Rip get one of your li'l buddies?

05:28.030 --> 05:29.909
My condolences.

05:31.453 --> 05:33.416
AUGUST 6TH

05:33.416 --> 05:35.378
UNION - ROUNDTABLE ROOM

05:38.719 --> 05:40.430
Cool it, Tatiana.

05:40.556 --> 05:42.894
He killed Ms. Gena!

05:43.227 --> 05:46.985
Yeah, I know. But fighting among members
is strictly forbidden.

05:46.985 --> 05:47.778
But!

05:47.862 --> 05:49.949
I see at least one of 'em's got a quick temper.

05:49.949 --> 05:50.743
Huh?

05:54.249 --> 05:55.376
Stop this.

05:55.586 --> 05:57.715
Huh? Is it hot in here...

05:57.924 --> 06:01.430
I'm sorry, Boss!
Please, I don't want to kill Mr. Billy!

06:01.723 --> 06:04.186
You win. I give up.

06:04.353 --> 06:05.773
How very noble.

06:12.452 --> 06:14.749
I need to see you out back... Zombie!

06:15.166 --> 06:16.043
Wuzzat?

06:17.087 --> 06:21.053
I'm Undead, ball brat.

06:21.596 --> 06:22.890
They're having a fight.

06:24.811 --> 06:26.313
Wish they'd take it someplace else, then.

06:26.564 --> 06:28.860
I wonder which one will win?

06:32.618 --> 06:33.662
Hey, stay back.

06:33.662 --> 06:34.706
S-Sure.

06:40.843 --> 06:42.972
NICO'S COMBAT TEST SITE

06:43.305 --> 06:44.726
I'm letting you know now.

06:44.726 --> 06:48.984
The others may have accepted you,
but I still don't recognize you as one of us.

06:49.819 --> 06:52.825
This is revenge... for Ms. Gena!

07:02.553 --> 07:06.644
You were clueless about her feelings,
and trampled them!

07:13.617 --> 07:15.286
40 years...

07:18.042 --> 07:21.633
You were oblivious to the feelings
she carried within while she waited!

07:22.593 --> 07:23.595
I knew.

07:25.056 --> 07:31.694
I knew Gena was in love with me.
But I killed her anyway. That's a fact.

07:32.362 --> 07:33.657
I won't deny it.

07:34.742 --> 07:36.036
Andy...

07:43.342 --> 07:47.643
That's all the more reason...
that I can't forgive you!

07:58.957 --> 08:00.251
Nailed it!

08:14.655 --> 08:16.701
I thought I told ya to stay back!

08:16.701 --> 08:17.870
I-I'm sorry!

08:22.796 --> 08:24.800
<i>He protected Unluck...</i>

08:25.510 --> 08:32.232
<i>Or rather, if Undead hadn't protected her...
I would've...</i>

08:33.735 --> 08:36.824
Tatiana. You need to calm down.

08:37.408 --> 08:41.918
<i>The next quest will reveal if those two
are cut out to be in the organization.</i>

08:42.252 --> 08:45.884
And I'm sure Gena wouldn't want you
fighting each other, anyway.

08:46.844 --> 08:47.805
But...

08:47.972 --> 08:49.558
Gotcha!

08:50.811 --> 08:52.815
Now then, where should I strike first?

08:54.944 --> 08:56.446
Aah!

09:05.549 --> 09:08.429
What? I haven't even done anything yet.

09:08.429 --> 09:10.517
Oh, yes you did!
You're the worst, you know!

09:14.274 --> 09:19.702
<i>Three minutes until compulsory release of UT Area.
Evacuation of one km radius is advised.</i>

09:19.785 --> 09:24.754
Undead! Take Unluck and get out of here!
Or else that girl is dead!

09:24.962 --> 09:25.630
Huh?

09:25.881 --> 09:31.266
<i>That armor isn't meant to protect her body!
It acts as a restraint to contain her ability!</i>

09:31.266 --> 09:33.813
<i>Once released,
it's capable of wiping out an entire town!</i>

09:33.938 --> 09:35.817
Grab the PCs and run for it!

09:35.817 --> 09:36.736
Are you serious?

09:37.070 --> 09:38.155
This is an emergency announcement!

09:38.531 --> 09:42.497
Initiating emergency relocation of UMA
and Artifact Storage to Level Four!

09:59.489 --> 10:02.370
If you're on floors five or below,
get to a higher level on the double...

10:02.370 --> 10:04.249
...unless you want to end up as mincemeat!

10:04.583 --> 10:06.963
You dimwits better protect every piece
of data with your lives!

10:07.380 --> 10:09.844
Don't worry, I got you,
my pwecious li'l PC!

10:09.844 --> 10:11.138
Cripes, you're fast!

10:11.263 --> 10:13.560
Top! Collect the stragglers!

10:13.685 --> 10:15.312
Already on it!

10:15.981 --> 10:17.150
Tatiana...

10:19.320 --> 10:22.536
Wah! I'm scared!

10:22.619 --> 10:23.746
Hey, Tatiana!

10:26.001 --> 10:29.550
It's okay! Just calm down.
I'm sorry you had to see something weird!

10:29.842 --> 10:32.765
Hey, just what're you calling weird?

10:34.602 --> 10:37.273
What's with you two clinging to my camera?

10:37.273 --> 10:39.820
What are you doing?
You heard what Mr. Nico said, right?

10:39.820 --> 10:41.031
I've lost control!

10:41.031 --> 10:43.536
<i>Three minutes until compulsory release of UT Area.</i>

10:43.536 --> 10:48.755
<i>That armor isn't meant to protect her body!
It acts as a restraint to contain her ability!</i>

10:48.755 --> 10:51.134
<i>Once released,
it's capable of wiping out an entire town!</i>

10:51.384 --> 10:54.349
Undead!
Take Unluck and get out of here!

10:54.683 --> 10:56.687
Unless you want to end up as mincemeat!

10:57.021 --> 10:58.398
Hurry and run!

10:59.902 --> 11:00.570
No!

11:01.906 --> 11:03.242
Besides, it was me!

11:03.408 --> 11:04.118
Huh?

11:06.373 --> 11:11.926
I'm the one who killed Ms. Gena!
My Unluck killed her!

11:12.553 --> 11:16.184
Andy was fighting to protect me!

11:17.646 --> 11:23.825
So... the one you should hold a grudge against... is me!

11:27.415 --> 11:29.252
I'm sorry, Tatiana.

11:29.837 --> 11:35.807
I'll do my best with Andy in the Union...
and make up for the loss of Ms. Gena!

11:37.435 --> 11:43.740
So please, tell me more!
About you, and about Ms. Gena!

11:48.917 --> 11:50.461
I want us to be friends!

11:59.647 --> 12:01.066
It's stopped.

12:07.453 --> 12:09.917
AUGUST 22ND

12:12.714 --> 12:19.728
Pan pa-pan pan pa-pan,
so I'm pan-panda, not bread...

12:22.316 --> 12:25.824
Um, excuse me... mind if I come in?

12:31.711 --> 12:34.758
Oh, wow! So many cute ones!

12:34.758 --> 12:36.762
I know. And none of them are for you.

12:36.762 --> 12:39.977
Oh, I would never take one!
These little guys are special to you, aren't they?

12:41.731 --> 12:46.699
Listen. I'm sorry about the other day.
I thought we could maybe shake and patch things up.

12:47.826 --> 12:51.166
I can't.
As you can plainly see, I am-

12:51.416 --> 12:52.502
It's fine.

12:55.299 --> 12:57.846
I want to shake your current hand, Tatiana...

12:57.846 --> 13:00.894
...and I want you to shake mine as it is now.

13:02.021 --> 13:07.281
Someday, when we're free of our Negator powers
and have normal bodies...

13:08.868 --> 13:11.122
...let's go out together hand in hand, okay?

13:15.590 --> 13:16.424
Okay.

13:25.150 --> 13:26.069
Thanks.

13:27.154 --> 13:29.283
I didn't do squat.

13:31.539 --> 13:32.331
You good?

13:33.835 --> 13:37.341
Oh, wait. I just realized
if I release my power, we'll die.

13:37.676 --> 13:40.557
I'm sorry, I ended up being useless after all.

13:41.057 --> 13:42.519
Huh? Whoa, what the-?

13:46.735 --> 13:48.238
Tatiana.

13:48.238 --> 13:50.577
Killing Unrepair is the highest priority now!

13:50.869 --> 13:53.331
<i>Sorry, but it doesn't look like
I can come back you up.</i>

13:53.708 --> 13:54.960
No need.

13:56.379 --> 13:57.591
Zombie...

13:57.591 --> 13:58.885
Get to the top deck.

13:59.636 --> 14:00.387
Huh?

14:01.097 --> 14:02.099
Just do it!

14:04.646 --> 14:10.575
<i>In spite of my body,
she treated me normally without laughing or pitying me.</i>

14:11.702 --> 14:14.625
<i>She's the first female friend I've ever made.</i>

14:15.668 --> 14:20.845
I won't forgive you...
hurting someone so special to me.

14:21.095 --> 14:23.559
I'll pulverize every last one of you!

14:24.268 --> 14:26.982
UT Area voluntary release!

14:29.236 --> 14:31.909
Just hold on, Fuko!
I'm coming to save you!

14:52.491 --> 14:56.625
Hey, are we really leaving already?
Without taking anything?

14:58.003 --> 14:59.255
Oh, I swiped some stuff.

15:00.090 --> 15:02.512
I pretty much snagged whatever seemed fit for you guys.

15:05.100 --> 15:06.979
You've got some sticky fingers.

15:07.396 --> 15:08.691
I'll divvy it up later.

15:10.444 --> 15:12.866
Anyway, what are we doing about Creed and Feng?

15:13.324 --> 15:14.076
Hm?

15:19.671 --> 15:22.927
Whuzzat? Exposin' your center on your own?

15:23.428 --> 15:26.059
Then I won't be shy about pumpin' ya full of lead!

15:30.108 --> 15:33.783
A few shots slipped through the cracks!
This li'l game's all ours!

15:33.783 --> 15:34.826
IT'S NO USE
Méiyou yòng.

15:34.826 --> 15:35.828
Huh?

15:40.128 --> 15:42.424
Got another barrier inside that thing, eh?

15:42.424 --> 15:43.594
In that case...

15:45.932 --> 15:46.600
Feng.

15:50.148 --> 15:52.987
Sneaky techniques aren't usually my style,
but oh, well.

15:56.829 --> 15:59.584
Poison gas.
Kills anyone who inhales it in three minutes.

15:59.584 --> 16:02.131
If solids don't work,
let's see if gas does the trick.

16:02.632 --> 16:06.347
Now then... have fun choking
to death in that ball of yours.

16:14.573 --> 16:19.415
<i>Tatiana is a Self-Targeting
Compulsory Activation type of Negator.</i>

16:20.292 --> 16:27.431
<i>She was born in Russia to a very normal family,
but her life took a turn on her fifth birthday.</i>

16:28.474 --> 16:30.938
Happy birthday, Tatiana.

16:31.607 --> 16:36.032
Wow, strawberry cake!
My favorite!

16:36.867 --> 16:38.453
<i>That was the day...</i>

16:40.875 --> 16:42.629
<i>...the ability transferred to her.</i>

16:51.980 --> 16:56.698
<i>Blood of her parents crushed to death
and the remains of their home were scattered everywhere.</i>

16:57.449 --> 17:01.165
<i>The police rushed to the scene after receiving reports
from residents in the vicinity.</i>

17:01.165 --> 17:03.378
<i>Dazed and confused,
Tatiana went on the run, when...</i>

17:17.030 --> 17:18.826
<i>...the mafia captured her.</i>

17:21.748 --> 17:25.005
Now, for the main auction item of the night!

17:25.005 --> 17:30.181
A little Negator girl from Russia who negates
the touch of any and all things!

17:32.394 --> 17:35.818
Her feed must go through
a specially designed tube, but...

17:36.068 --> 17:41.705
...since she repels all impurities,
she is the perfect ornamental piece!

17:42.080 --> 17:44.669
Now then, the bidding will start at 100 million!

17:45.003 --> 17:46.213
150 million!

17:46.422 --> 17:47.215
160!

17:47.717 --> 17:48.510
200 million!

17:50.556 --> 17:53.604
Okay, that's 200 million!
Do I hear higher?

18:08.424 --> 18:13.309
Every time I come to one of these places...
I start thinking being blind isn't so bad after all.

18:13.686 --> 18:15.146
You! What in the hell-

18:20.198 --> 18:21.743
You Tatiana?

18:25.960 --> 18:27.129
Kill me.

18:29.216 --> 18:34.435
Put your gun in my mouth and fire.
That'll be enough to kill me.

18:35.813 --> 18:39.194
Nothing good comes from living in this body.

18:39.821 --> 18:44.246
I can't dress up.
I can't hold a plushie.

18:44.246 --> 18:46.751
I can't even eat my favorite cake.

18:47.795 --> 18:49.006
But most importantly...

18:51.427 --> 18:56.813
I want to hurry to Mommy and Daddy,
and tell them I'm sorry.

18:59.234 --> 19:02.825
All right.
Then open wide.

19:04.328 --> 19:05.246
Okay...

19:11.008 --> 19:14.139
Ta-da! Supervised creation by yours truly,
a real sweets lover...

19:14.139 --> 19:15.935
The Long Cake Bar!

19:22.364 --> 19:26.455
Your ability produces an untouchable barrier
from the surface of your hair and skin.

19:26.455 --> 19:31.215
But opening your mouth creates a hole in the barrier, right?
I read about it in the dossier!

19:33.010 --> 19:40.149
I heard you're usually fed liquid food through a tube.
So I tried making these. So, how are they?

19:43.197 --> 19:43.907
Hey.

19:44.241 --> 19:44.993
Hm?

19:46.370 --> 19:49.669
What other flavors are there?

19:51.798 --> 19:55.138
For now, this is maximum compression.

19:55.138 --> 19:57.350
Gotcha. Thanks for this.

19:57.977 --> 19:59.814
Thank you, Mr. Nico.

20:00.023 --> 20:02.695
Save the thanks.
Just give me data.

20:03.195 --> 20:08.749
<i>With the help of Nico's restraints,
Tatiana contained her barrier which grew bigger each year.</i>

20:09.082 --> 20:13.967
<i>She became able to control manipulators with
her brain waves just as she would actual limbs.</i>

20:14.636 --> 20:20.146
However, you're suppressing a lot of force.
Unleashing it will cause a huge recoil.

20:20.480 --> 20:25.699
It can become a weapon or a disaster,
so be careful.

20:25.699 --> 20:26.367
Yeah.

20:26.993 --> 20:30.375
Mr. Billy, what does he mean by "weapon"?

20:33.422 --> 20:36.721
Your power doesn't just cause people harm at random.

20:37.556 --> 20:41.438
There's gonna come a day when you use it
to protect someone important.

20:43.735 --> 20:48.578
When that time eventually comes,
let it loose of your own free will.

20:50.582 --> 20:52.586
Tatiana, I made it to the top deck!

20:57.513 --> 21:00.686
I'd rather destroy everything than let him get away!

21:00.936 --> 21:01.646
Wazzat?

21:02.022 --> 21:05.361
No more of this to someone special to me.

21:06.280 --> 21:09.787
I won't let you touch her...
not a single finger!

21:39.221 --> 21:41.266
Zombie! Do you see Unrepair?

21:41.433 --> 21:46.276
Oh, yeah! I spotted him all right!
And I have your ability to thank for that!

21:55.921 --> 21:59.971
Let us... handle the rest!

22:04.020 --> 22:09.030
TO BE CONTINUED

23:39.044 --> 23:39.587
PREVIEW

23:40.046 --> 23:42.926
<i>Trust from the unlucky girl and the boy's resolve</i>

23:42.926 --> 23:47.393
<i>guides the awakening of the steel girl
and draws forth the determination of the undead man.</i>

23:47.519 --> 23:51.736
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 14-Crimson Bullet.</i>

23:51.778 --> 23:53.990
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
